[node name="Info" type="Node2D" parent="."]
script = ExtResource("text")
position = Vector2(400, 640)
text = "KitElevator: both of you on it, and the one its wheel glows for strikes it: it starts.
Then strike the wheel on the beat, as it told you just before: blue P1, orange P2, green both.
A hit: up a stage. A miss: down two, and it stops; strike again to go on.
This one: \"1.t.-2.t.-\": a strike a bar, told two beats ahead."

